Everywhere adaptation: 2026-11-24. The bundled CLI is Bluetooth-only.
The original USB backend and its pymobiledevice3 dependency are omitted.
Pairing, authentication, location subscription and delivery remain distinct.
The bundled macOS authentication provider uses the matching credential in Contents/Resources/asset/mfi by default.
An explicitly selected external provider can also manage its own identity.
Corresponding source and build instructions are included in source.tar.gz.
